        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This casual puzzle game features beautiful graphics that make up:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tianmen Mountain, formerly known as Songliang Mountain, is a tourist attraction located in Yongding District, Zhangjiajie City, Hunan Province. The mountain top covers an area of 2 square kilometers and is a typical karst landform with an altitude of 1518.6 meters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4193360/extras/f25c6ab69770b7be8675a790b52804e6.avif?t=1764894787\" width=800 height=800 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game starts:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Click on 'start game', the image will be grayed out, and the colored parts will be randomly scrambled into 16 small fragments, scattered randomly on the screen</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game process:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players click on the small image, drag it to its original position to restore it, until all the small images move to the correct position, and the game ends</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >End or start the next game:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All the small fragments move to the correct position, and the game ends. At this point, click &quot;try again&quot; to repeat the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p>",
